				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$$F(z)=R{{\rm{e}}}^{-\frac{z}{{h}_{1}}}+(1-R){{\rm{e}}}^{-\frac{z}{{h}_{2}}}$$\end{document}F(z)=Re−zh1+(1−R)e−zh2where z is depth (positive downwards), R = 0.58, h1 = 0.35 m and h2 = 23 m.
